# The Bishop's first class node: its party half is worth more than a cut to
# damage taken.
#
# Two halves, which GMS keeps separate. The Bishop's own is flat: 33% final
# damage at max, whatever their INT or party. Everyone else's grows with the
# Bishop's INT and is then capped to a share of what the Bishop kept: one
# blessing split across everyone in the zone, so a party of two gets 17% each
# and a party of three 11%. See AllyIntLever.
#
# GMS's INT steps are kept exactly, though stats here don't reach GMS's: a
# Bishop here tops out near 8,700 INT against the 100,000+ of an endgame GMS
# Bishop, so the party gets a few points instead of the cap, and nobody reaches
# the attack speed yet. That is the ratio the description states; rescaling the
# steps would make it a different skill.
#
# Both ladders are smoothed to end exactly at GMS's max: half a point of final
# damage a level against GMS's `18+floor(x/2)`, and 0.35 seconds against its
# `20+floor(x/3)`. Level 1 is 0.5pp higher and 0.15s shorter.
#
# The cast is kBuffCastMs like every other buff, not its 360ms animation: buffs
# are cast from a sequence, which paces them all the same way.
#
# Dropped: the MP half of the recovery, since MP isn't tracked. Kept, though
# nothing uses them yet: the status clear, and the attack speed, which the
# Fastest 1 soft cap swallows for a party that already has its own +3.
name: "Benediction"
description:
  "Calls upon your holy power to create a consecrated space that empowers and "
  "revitalizes your allies. Increases your Final Damage, and your party's "
  "Final Damage, Attack Speed and HP recovery in proportion to your INT."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ACTIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_BISHOP_V skill_order: 1 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
base_delay_ms: 120
cooldown_seconds: 120.0
buff {
  duration_seconds: 19.85
  duration_seconds_per_level: 0.35
  base { final_dmg_pct: 0.185 }
  per_level { final_dmg_pct: 0.005 }
  ally_base {
    final_dmg_pct: 0.06
    regen_pct: 0.01
    regen_interval_seconds: 2.0
    cures_conditions: true
  }
  ally_int_lever {
    int_step: 3000
    effect { final_dmg_pct: 0.01 }
    cap_is_party_share: true
  }
  ally_int_lever {
    int_step: 2000
    effect { regen_pct: 0.01 }
    cap { regen_pct: 0.10 }
  }
  ally_int_lever {
    int_step: 10000
    effect { attack_speed: 1 }
    cap { attack_speed: 3 }
  }
}
